  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_headbb_01",
      "hash64": "912432F43F80D285",
      "text": "Tadaaa! Da wären wir![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_headbb_02",
      "hash64": "91242FF43F80CD6C",
      "text": "Herzlich willkommen an meiner geliebten\\nBlaubeer-Akademie![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_headbb_03",
      "hash64": "912430F43F80CF1F",
      "text": "Was du hier siehst, ist der Eingangsbereich.\\c\\nFast alle übrigen Teile der Akademie befinden\\nsich unter Wasser! Ist das nicht fantastisch?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_headbb_04",
      "hash64": "91242DF43F80CA06",
      "text": "Und das ist noch nicht alles![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_headbb_05",
      "hash64": "91242EF43F80CBB9",
      "text": "Siehst du, wie herrlich blau hier alles ist?\\nWir haben uns stark vom Farbton der\\r\\nBlaubeere inspirieren lassen.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 113,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_headbb_06",
      "hash64": "91242BF43F80C6A0",
      "text": "Mal sehen, was noch?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_headbb_07",
      "hash64": "91242CF43F80C853",
      "text": "Hm... Hast du vielleicht erst mal Fragen an mich?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_select_01",
      "hash64": "65A9E70EAD5FA5C7",
      "text": "Warum ist die Akademie unter Wasser?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_select_02",
      "hash64": "65A9E80EAD5FA77A",
      "text": "Woher kommt der Name der Akademie?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_select_03",
      "hash64": "65A9E90EAD5FA92D",
      "text": "Woher kennen Sie Direktor Clavel?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_headbb_08",
      "hash64": "912439F43F80DE6A",
      "text": "Oh? Du stellst aber komische Fragen.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_headbb_09",
      "hash64": "91243AF43F80E01D",
      "text": "Nun ja. Äh, also, das ist so...[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_fairybb_01",
      "hash64": "EE9DFBF44274CAB6",
      "text": "Ich habe gehört, dass die Akademie an eine\\nAnlage am Meeresboden angeschlossen ist,\\r\\ndie der Ressourcenentwicklung dient.[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 123,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_fairybb_02",
      "hash64": "EE9DFAF44274C903",
      "text": "Die Blaubeere steht in der Sprache der Blumen\\nfür ein ertragreiches Leben.\\c\\nDeshalb wurde angeblich dieser Name gewählt.[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_fairybb_03",
      "hash64": "EE9DF9F44274C750",
      "text": "Direktor Cyano und Direktor Clavel haben\\nan derselben Universität studiert.\\c\\nDas hab ich zumindest gehört.[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 108,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_headbb_10",
      "hash64": "9127B7F43F83EA5B",
      "text": "Ja, genau! Das wollte ich auch gerade sagen![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_headbb_11",
      "hash64": "9127B6F43F83E8A8",
      "text": "Du bist wirklich gut informiert, Tara.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_fairybb_04",
      "hash64": "EE9E00F44274D335",
      "text": "Ach, nicht der Rede wert.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_fairybb_05",
      "hash64": "EE9DFFF44274D182",
      "text": "Und wen haben Sie da bei sich? Einen Gast?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_headbb_12",
      "hash64": "9127B9F43F83EDC1",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Ganz recht! Das ist [VAR 0x0100(0000)].\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0302,0000)]ErSie ist\\r\\nzum\\r\\nAustausch hier.\\r\\nIch bin sicher,\\r\\nihr werdet\\r\\neuch\\r\\nprächtig\\r\\nverstehen![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
