        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_fairybb_06",
      "hash64": "EE9DFEF44274CFCF",
      "text": "Was?! Ist das etwa [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0D0B,0000)]der Schülerdie Schülerin aus Paldea,\\nvon [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0303,0000)]demder ich gehört habe?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0D0B",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0303",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_fairybb_07",
      "hash64": "EE9DFDF44274CE1C",
      "text": "Entschuldige, ich sollte mich zuerst vorstellen.\\nMein Name ist Tara! Ich bin im zweiten Jahr hier.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_fairybb_08",
      "hash64": "EE9E04F44274DA01",
      "text": "Es ist recht selten, dass sich Direktor Cyano\\nden Namen eines Schülers merkt, also musst\\r\\ndu echt was Besonderes sein.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 120,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_headbb_13",
      "hash64": "9127B8F43F83EC0E",
      "text": "Oje, ertappt...![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_headbb_14",
      "hash64": "9127BBF43F83F127",
      "text": "Oh! Aber wo du gerade hier bist, Tara...\\nWieso stellst du unserem Neuankömmling\\r\\ndie Akademie nicht etwas genauer vor?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 120,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_fairybb_09",
      "hash64": "EE9E03F44274D84E",
      "text": "Wie bitte?! Ich soll das machen?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_headbb_15",
      "hash64": "9127BAF43F83EF74",
      "text": "Deinen Erklärungen kann man vermutlich mehr\\ntrauen als meinen.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_fairybb_10",
      "hash64": "EE9A76F44271B2E0",
      "text": "Das mag sein, aber es gibt doch sicher jemanden,\\nder geeigneter dafür ist als ich...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_fairybb_11",
      "hash64": "EE9A77F44271B493",
      "text": "Oh, bitte versteh mich nicht falsch.\\nDas hat nichts mit dir zu tun![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_fairybb_12",
      "hash64": "EE9A78F44271B646",
      "text": "Direktor Cyano hat nur die Angewohnheit,\\nArbeit auf andere abzuwälzen...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_fairybb_13",
      "hash64": "EE9A79F44271B7F9",
      "text": "Und das ist ein absolutes No-Go![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_headbb_16",
      "hash64": "9127BDF43F83F48D",
      "text": "Uff, ich bitte um Gnade...[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
